    { "dot": "cyan", "title": "Edge / Gate", "items": [
      "Traefik :8088 routes /api/orders → order-service, /api/inventory → inventory-service, /ws → websocket-service",
      "JWT ForwardAuth to auth-service:8083/verify; protected-chain = jwt-auth + rate-limit + security-headers",
      "Public /health router uses public-chain (no auth)"
    ]},
    { "dot": "emerald", "title": "Application & State", "items": [
      "Order-service outbox publisher → Kafka topics order.created / paid / confirmed / cancelled / shipped / delivered / status.changed (cmd/order-service/main.go:90)",
      "Inventory-service consumes order.created (group inventory-service-orders) and writes inventory.reservation_failed to Kafka (internal/inventory/adapter/kafka/order_event_handler.go:181-207)",
      "WebSocket subscribes Redis channels order.events + inventory.events — zero .Publish() matches in repo (verified gap)",
      "Redis caches: order 5min TTL, inventory 30s TTL; DLQ topic dead_letter configured in pkg/kafka/consumer.go:196"
    ]},
    { "dot": "rose", "title": "Verified Gaps / Notes", "items": [
      "Kafka topic inventory.reserved (line 125) is consumed by order-service (cmd/order-service/main.go:101) but has no in-repo producer",
      "Kafka inventory.reserved + Redis pub/sub channels lack verified producers — diagram edges shown dashed with gap notation",
